tanding golf get close up to the  players and i mean even with social  distancing in the way that we are living  these days you still can really see um  some fantastic golf i've been coming out  here for so many years and it's really  my favorite favorite time to see golf  it's such a fun time and yes you got to  check it out sydney congratulations  you're an amazing ambassador thank you  tammy so much we appreciate it shriner's  children's open october 7th through the  10th tpc summerland check it out you  don't want to miss it tickets are  available at  shrinerschildrensopen.com we'll be right  back  [Music]
 

